# IntelliJ / Android Studio project state — entirely IDE-local. New AS
# versions keep adding files (appInsightsSettings.xml, studiobot.xml, …)
# that are noise in diffs and confusing for F-Droid reviewers (the
# Crashlytics-tab placeholder in appInsightsSettings.xml in particular
# looked like a tracker integration when it isn't). Blanket exclude.
/.idea/
.DS_Store
/build
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
local.properties
.kotlin
